  "cues": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "scene": 0,
      "startFrame": 3,
      "endFrame": 60,
      "measuredSeconds": 1.872,
      "text": "你姓什么？"
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "scene": 0,
      "startFrame": 63,
      "endFrame": 172,
      "measuredSeconds": 3.624,
      "text": "这个问题，你几乎不用思考。"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "scene": 0,
      "startFrame": 175,
      "endFrame": 334,
      "measuredSeconds": 5.28,
      "text": "但如果再问一句：这个姓，为什么会来到你身上？"
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "scene": 0,
      "startFrame": 337,
      "endFrame": 445,
      "measuredSeconds": 3.576,
      "text": "答案，就要向历史深处寻找。"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "scene": 1,
      "startFrame": 469,
      "endFrame": 580,
      "measuredSeconds": 3.696,
      "text": "今天，我们把“姓氏”连在一起说。"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "scene": 1,
      "startFrame": 599,
      "endFrame": 783,
      "measuredSeconds": 6.12,
      "text": "可在先秦，尤其是周代贵族的称谓中，姓与氏并不相同。"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "scene": 1,
      "startFrame": 802,
      "endFrame": 982,
      "measuredSeconds": 5.976,
      "text": "姓标示较大的血缘群体，氏则区分其中的宗族分支。"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "scene": 1,
      "startFrame": 1001,
      "endFrame": 1179,
      "measuredSeconds": 5.928,
      "text": "可以把它想象成一棵树：同一树干，也会长出不同枝条。"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "scene": 2,
      "startFrame": 1250,
      "endFrame": 1383,
      "measuredSeconds": 4.416,
      "text": "到秦汉时期，两者的区别逐渐淡化。"
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "scene": 2,
      "startFrame": 1433,
      "endFrame": 1569,
      "measuredSeconds": 4.512,
      "text": "“姓”与“氏”，慢慢合流成了我们熟悉的姓氏。"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "scene": 2,
      "startFrame": 1619,
      "endFrame": 1750,
      "measuredSeconds": 4.344,
      "text": "称呼的变化背后，是社会秩序的变化。"
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "scene": 3,
      "startFrame": 1836,
      "endFrame": 1955,
      "measuredSeconds": 3.936,
      "text": "但这条历史线，并没有从此静止。"
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "scene": 3,
      "startFrame": 1991,
      "endFrame": 2149,
      "measuredSeconds": 5.256,
      "text": "北魏孝文帝改革时，皇室的拓跋氏改为元氏。"
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "scene": 3,
      "startFrame": 2185,
      "endFrame": 2359,
      "measuredSeconds": 5.784,
      "text": "一个姓的改变，也留下了制度变迁与文化交融的痕迹。"
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "scene": 3,
      "startFrame": 2395,
      "endFrame": 2516,
      "measuredSeconds": 4.008,
      "text": "姓氏不只被继承，也会被改写。"
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "scene": 4,
      "startFrame": 2591,
      "endFrame": 2748,
      "measuredSeconds": 5.232,
      "text": "人们又带着这些姓，离开故土，建立新的家园。"
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "scene": 4,
      "startFrame": 2789,
      "endFrame": 2984,
      "measuredSeconds": 6.48,
      "text": "地图上的距离越来越远，一个熟悉的字，却可能被一代代保留下来。"
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "scene": 4,
      "startFrame": 3025,
      "endFrame": 3199,
      "measuredSeconds": 5.784,
      "text": "它像一条线，连接着曾经的生活，也连接着今天的我们。"
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "scene": 5,
      "startFrame": 3247,
      "endFrame": 3358,
      "measuredSeconds": 3.696,
      "text": "所以，当你再次说出“我姓什么”，"
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "scene": 5,
      "startFrame": 3365,
      "endFrame": 3467,
      "measuredSeconds": 3.384,
      "text": "你说出的，是自己的身份，"
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "scene": 5,
      "startFrame": 3474,
      "endFrame": 3570,
      "measuredSeconds": 3.192,
      "text": "也是一个值得继续追问的问题："
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "scene": 5,
      "startFrame": 3577,
      "endFrame": 3712,
      "measuredSeconds": 4.488,
      "text": "在这个名字之前，发生过怎样的历史？"
    }
  ],
  "music": "Original synthesized pentatonic ambient tones; no sampled music",
  "peak": 0.7607829228891494
}